Jill to France.

00:02:45.467 --> 00:02:46.934
[ Laughter ]

00:02:46.934 --> 00:02:48.767
Seriously, Biden eats dinner at
3:00 p.m.

00:02:48.767 --> 00:02:50.167
How hard is it to get a table?

00:02:50.167 --> 00:02:53.167
[ Laughter ]

00:02:53.167 --> 00:02:55.634
Yep, Biden ordered takeout,
which was kind of fun because

00:02:55.634 --> 00:02:57.267
it's not often you see
an Uber Eats guy

00:02:57.267 --> 00:02:58.667
with a Secret Service motorcade.

00:02:58.667 --> 00:02:59.868
[ Laughter ]

00:02:59.868 --> 00:03:02.033
"I accidentally went to
Pennsylvania Street.

00:03:02.033 --> 00:03:06.100
I didn't know 1200 Pennsylvania
Street was the place, but..."

00:03:06.100 --> 00:03:07.834
[ Laughter ]

00:03:07.834 --> 00:03:09.434
The delivery guy called him
like, "Sorry --"

00:03:09.434 --> 00:03:11.434
Oh, sorry, that was the joke
I just did.

00:03:11.434 --> 00:03:12.767
Oops.

00:03:12.767 --> 00:03:14.901
[ Laughter ]

00:03:14.901 --> 00:03:16.834
Should have came --
-Whoa!

00:03:16.834 --> 00:03:23.501
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:23.501 --> 00:03:24.934
-I should have came to
rehearsal.

00:03:24.934 --> 00:03:27.667
[ Laughter ]

00:03:27.667 --> 00:03:29.701
Yep, Valentine's Day was
yesterday.

00:03:29.701 --> 00:03:31.200
Personally, I had a great time.

00:03:31.200 --> 00:03:33.701
Nancy and I got dinner at one of
our favorite spots.

00:03:33.701 --> 00:03:35.067
Tariq, what did you do?

00:03:35.067 --> 00:03:37.133
-Oh, my wife and I got
a babysitter so we could just

00:03:37.133 --> 00:03:38.901
chill at home,
just the two of us.

00:03:38.901 --> 00:03:41.000
You know, catch up on our shows
and order takeout.

00:03:41.000 --> 00:03:43.634
-That's sweet. Higgins, how was
your Valentine's Day?

00:03:43.634 --> 00:03:45.868
-Not great.

00:03:45.868 --> 00:03:48.334
I got catfished.

00:03:48.334 --> 00:03:50.801
-Sorry.
Wait, aren't you married?

00:03:50.801 --> 00:03:52.601
-Yeah, I got catfished by
my wife.

00:03:52.601 --> 00:03:54.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:54.734 --> 00:03:56.734
-How is that possible?

00:03:56.734 --> 00:03:59.434
-Well, I never met her in
person. We would just FaceTime.

00:03:59.434 --> 00:04:01.067
But last night, I was like,

00:04:01.067 --> 00:04:02.534
"Hey, we've been married
like 30 years.

00:04:02.534 --> 00:04:03.667
Maybe we should meet."

00:04:03.667 --> 00:04:05.267
But then she blocked me
on Facebook.

00:04:05.267 --> 00:04:06.167
[ Laughter ]

00:04:06.167 --> 00:04:08.234
-But you have kids with her.

00:04:08.234 --> 00:04:11.334
-Turns out my kids were
catfishing me too.

00:04:11.334 --> 00:04:12.367
[ Laughter ]

00:04:12.367 --> 00:04:13.701
-What?
-Yeah.

00:04:13.701 --> 00:04:16.667
