my children.

00:04:16.667 --> 00:04:18.400
I guess most of them used to
work on "iCarly."

00:04:18.400 --> 00:04:20.767
[ Laughter ]

00:04:20.767 --> 00:04:22.667
-Why is this happening to you?

00:04:22.667 --> 00:04:25.567
-I guess that Roku is doing
a new prank show called

00:04:25.567 --> 00:04:28.067
"Steve Higgins' Whole Life
Is a Lie."

00:04:28.067 --> 00:04:32.200
It's like "The Truman Show"
but not heartwarming at all.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.734
You know what the worst thing
is, Jimmy?

00:04:33.734 --> 00:04:35.501
-I haven't heard the worst thing
so far?

00:04:35.501 --> 00:04:36.801
-No.

00:04:36.801 --> 00:04:38.434
I'm not even the announcer for
"The Tonight Show."

00:04:38.434 --> 00:04:39.968
[ Laughter ]

00:04:39.968 --> 00:04:41.601
-You're not?
-No.

00:04:41.601 --> 00:04:43.667
