00:04:47.033 --> 00:04:49.767
I gotta go, Jimmy.
My mom's calling me for dinner.

00:04:49.767 --> 00:04:51.601
-What's going on?

00:04:51.601 --> 00:04:54.901
-Okay, Mom.
I'll be right there. God.

00:04:54.901 --> 00:04:57.167
[ Applause ]

00:04:57.167 --> 00:04:58.868
-Steve Higgins.

00:04:58.868 --> 00:05:01.701
I love that character.
That is a great guy.

00:05:01.701 --> 00:05:02.834
Wow, amazing.

00:05:02.834 --> 00:05:06.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:05:06.767 --> 00:05:08.567
